A model in production

The `Feature store` feeds the `Trainer`. The `Trainer` writes to the
`Model registry`. `Serving` loads from the `Model registry` and reads the
`Feature store`. The `App` calls `Serving`. The `App` must not call the
`Trainer`. We guess that `Serving` logs to `Monitoring`.
---
Feature store -> Trainer: feed
Trainer -> Model registry: write
Serving -> Model registry: load
Serving -> Feature store: read
App -> Serving
App -x Trainer
Serving -> Monitoring: log ?
